# pureiron/core-test — release별 core 통합 테스트 이미지(n-minus-1 게이트: N-1 앱 테스트를 N 스키마에서 실행).
ARG PYTHON_IMAGE=python:3.12-slim-trixie@sha256:dddfd7e07f9d15aeeca61529320492139d21cac7f0070c00609243e51e4e0016
ARG UV_IMAGE=ghcr.io/astral-sh/uv:0.10.12@sha256:72ab0aeb448090480ccabb99fb5f52b0dc3c71923bffb5e2e26517a1c27b7fec

FROM ${UV_IMAGE} AS uv

FROM ${PYTHON_IMAGE} AS build
COPY --from=uv /uv /usr/local/bin/uv
ENV UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=/opt/pureiron/venv \
    UV_PYTHON_DOWNLOADS=never \
    UV_COMPILE_BYTECODE=0 \
    UV_LINK_MODE=copy \
    UV_NO_CACHE=1
# uv.lock 그대로(dev 포함) 설치 후, 설치 시각 메타데이터(uv_cache.json)를 지운다(재현 빌드).
RUN --mount=type=bind,source=.,target=/src,rw \
    cd /src && uv sync --locked --no-editable --package pureiron-core \
      --python /usr/local/bin/python3.12 \
    && python3 /src/deploy/build/normalize_venv.py /opt/pureiron/venv

FROM ${PYTHON_IMAGE}
COPY --from=build /opt/pureiron/venv /opt/pureiron/venv
COPY pyproject.toml /opt/pureiron/pyproject.toml
COPY services/core/migrations /opt/pureiron/services/core/migrations
COPY services/core/tests /opt/pureiron/services/core/tests
WORKDIR /opt/pureiron
ENV PATH=/opt/pureiron/venv/bin:$PATH \
    PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \
    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \
    PUREIRON_MIGRATIONS_DIR=/opt/pureiron/services/core/migrations
USER 10001:10001
ENTRYPOINT ["pytest", "-p", "no:cacheprovider", "-m", "integration", "services/core/tests/integration"]
